From b33a4d50fb56b87f4d88c88ee53a0b01105121b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lena Okafor <lena.okafor@example.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 17:06:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(server): filter GET /v1/sessions by tag

Add a tag query parameter to the session list. tag=team:infra returns
sessions whose team tag is infra; a bare tag=team matches any value.
The store filters with an IN-subquery on conversation_labels, the same
shape as the pinned filter, so it composes with the ACL, project, and
archive filters and with cursor pagination.

Per-user pin keys are rejected with a 400 so the filter cannot probe
another user's pins; pinned=true already covers the caller's own.

Signed-off-by: Lena Okafor <lena.okafor@example.com>
