+The `tag` filter returns only sessions carrying a tag, the key/value
+pairs set through `labels` on create or `PATCH`. `tag=team:infra`
+matches the `team` tag with value `infra`; a bare `tag=team` matches
+any value. It combines with every other filter. Per-user pin keys
+cannot be used as tags (400); use `pinned=true` instead.
